   "text": "Bombtech Golf BombTech - 프리미엄 골프 웨지 세트 52 56 60도\n옵션 이미지\nBlack\nBlack |\nGOODS SPECIFICS\n- Size : 35 1/4\"\n- Color : Black\n- Golf Club Flex : Uniflex\n- Hand Orientation : Left\n- Golf Club Loft : 52 Degrees\n- Material : Steel\n- Brand : Bombtech Golf\n- Shaft Material : Steel\n- Item Weight : 1.43 Kilograms\n- Grip Size : Oversize\n- Grip Type : Standard\n- UPC : 850064238174\n- Golf Club Bounce Angle : 10 Degrees\n- Golf Club Type : Wedge Golf Club\n- Included Components : 52, 56, 60 Wedge\n- Manufacturer : BombTech Golf\n- Item Package Dimensions L x W x H : 37 x 4 x 3 inches\n- Package Weight : 1.43 Kilograms\n- Brand Name : Bombtech Golf\n- Warranty Description : 1.5 Years\n- Model Name : BombTech 52, 56, 60 Wedge Set - Left Handed\n- Suggested Users : mens\nFeature\n- PREMIUM QUALITY AT FRACTION OF THE PRICE: No retail and no pros means you get more for your money.\n- COMPLETE SET OF THREE WEDGES: Includes 52, 56 and 60 degree lofts with 12, 10 and 8 bounces.\n- MAX FORGIVENESS: Heavier weights for max control and feel provides for max forgiveness. The BombTech black golf wedges are slightly oversized to make even your bad shots look pretty freaking good.\n- OPTIMAL SPIN: Max legal groove depth for increased spin.\n- EASY TO HIT FROM ANYWHERE: Wedges that are easy to hit from anywhere. The micro-milled face provides for great spin, control and consistency from the fairway or rough.",
